      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (run once)\nCreates the three Data Tables the email → tasks workflow uses (safe to run again: existing tables are kept).\n- **n8n_email_tasks**: every task Claude found, with its Google Calendar event id or Google Tasks id\n- **n8n_processed_emails**: Gmail message ids already read, so no email is read twice\n- **n8n_email_senders**: per-sender stats, used to skip senders that never send tasks\n\nSee them under **Overview → Data tables**.",
        "width": 720,
        "height": 260
      },
